  id: quest.undercroft_job
  title: The Undercroft Job
  giver: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d0eaa6ab437133d89473d2dba27f1a9, type: 2}
  faction: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fba0a8fe9beb89c1f88b8c0dd2a76d54, type: 2}
  reason: Two farmhands went into the Undercroft after a noise and did not come out.
    The company posts the standard rate for a recovery and does not discuss the noise.
  complication: It is not a monster. Whatever is down there was dormant until they
    disturbed it, and the company will pay out either way rather than answer questions.
  availability: []
  stages:
  - Title: Go down and find out
    Summary: The Undercroft is south-east of Ashmere. Whatever is in it is still
      there. Put it down.
    Objectives:
    - Kind: 5
      Description: Deal with what is in the Undercroft
      Item: {fileID: 0}
      Npc: {fileID: 0}
      Location: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 81b4a19b9b843f84cb70b72e23138e55, type: 2}
      Enemy: {fileID: 0}
      Count: 1
    OnEnter: []
  - Title: Report it
    Summary: Tell Rowen Stagg what was down there, and see what they do with it.
    Objectives:
    - Kind: 3
      Description: Report to Rowen Stagg
      Item: {fileID: 0}
      Npc: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d0eaa6ab437133d89473d2dba27f1a9, type: 2}
      Location: {fileID: 0}
      Enemy: {fileID: 0}
      Count: 1
    OnEnter: []
